OL,3,AThousands of US flights still cancelled
OL,4,Aor delayed two days after grounding of
OL,5,Aplanes nationwide
OL,6,
OL,7,FThousands of US flights were cancelled
OL,8,For delayed on Sunday as the US
OL,9,Fair-traffic control system continued to
OL,10,Frecover from a technical failure that
OL,11,Fled to a rare national ground stop.
OL,13,FSecretary of Transportation Sean Duffy
OL,14,Fsaid normal operations may not be
OL,15,Frestored until Monday.
OL,17,F"We have airplanes and crews that are
OL,18,Fout of position, so it takes a little
OL,19,Fbit of time," he told the BBC's US
OL,20,Fpartner CBS. More than 5,000 flights
OL,21,Fwere delayed and 2,000 cancelled on
OL,22,FSunday.
OL,23,APub: 15-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
