OL,3,AThousands of US flights still cancelled
OL,4,Aor delayed two days after grounding of
OL,5,Aplanes nationwide
OL,6,
OL,7,FPresident Donald Trump urged Congress
OL,8,Fon Sunday to approve more money to
OL,9,Fmodernise the air-traffic control
OL,10,Fsystem. The grounding of all aircraft
OL,11,Fscheduled to depart the US on Friday
OL,12,Fcaused chaos at airports across the
OL,13,Fcountry.
